    "markdown": "# Handy tips & tricks\n![](/images/magic.png){style=\"width:200px; border-radius:15px; background:white\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\nWelcome to the final part of the workshops, Handy tips & tricks! \nThis part will include coding to reinforce what you have learnt up to this point. \nThere will also be plenty of new handy <u id='function_tooltip'>__functions__</u> and some more concepts to learn.\n\n## Setup\n\nFor this part create a directory called \"tips_and_tricks\" in your main directory and set it as the working directory. \nThen create a script called \"4-Handy_tips.R\". \nRemember to use annotations (`#`) and code sections (`####`)!\n\n## Sections & pages\n\nBelow is an overview of the contents of this part.\n\n- [R conventions](tips_tricks/variable_names.qmd): Conventions on variable names and wide vs long coding\n- [RStudio] \n- [Multiplication table](tips_tricks/multiplication_table.qmd): \n    - href: tips_tricks/tab_complete.qmd\n    - section: \"Example datasets\"\n      contents:\n      - href: tips_tricks/tea.qmd\n      - href: tips_tricks/english_speakers.qmd\n    - href: tips_tricks/identical.qmd\n    - href: tips_tricks/shortcuts.qmd\n    - href: tips_tricks/mcqs.qmd\n    - section: \"Exercises\"\n      contents:\n      - href: tips_tricks/handy_exercises.qmd\n\nI'll first introduce you to some R conventions and then some useful abilities of RStudio.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-2068ee405c7854f2266d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-2068ee405c7854f2266d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, /, *, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-7000daf91a55039bc9f5\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-7000daf91a55039bc9f5\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of an R object with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-929d0ad3ce83a9cd1a2c\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-929d0ad3ce83a9cd1a2c\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs a specific task\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-b32d920b4ec867c41785\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-b32d920b4ec867c41785\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object data type, e.g. integer, double, string, and logical\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-f3550a73be7bbdbaab5d\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-f3550a73be7bbdbaab5d\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_structure_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Object structure type, e.g. scalar, vector, and data frame\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-3f39ff02dc5cff791969\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3f39ff02dc5cff791969\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number without decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-ae2a9bedb4a4ab269a2a\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-ae2a9bedb4a4ab269a2a\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"double_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Number with decimal points\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8895e09fc00635943282\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8895e09fc00635943282\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-5a9be788f23dc143f12e\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-5a9be788f23dc143f12e\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"logical_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"TRUE or FALSE\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1f805bdbb81345ff0385\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1f805bdbb81345ff0385\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"scalar_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"A single value in a object\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a06dc06e59864dd3f028\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a06dc06e59864dd3f028\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"vector_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogenous 1-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-4e3ebfc4d091b28c6aad\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-4e3ebfc4d091b28c6aad\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"matrix_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Homogeneous 2-dimensional data structure\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-8397b007f32f2446bc7a\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-8397b007f32f2446bc7a\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"data_frame_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Heterogeneous 2-dimensional data structure. Each column is homogeneous\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-93f76f12038a8f3d0d97\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-93f76f12038a8f3d0d97\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"assignment_tooltip\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"<-\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
